the show.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-07-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"3MKXBAhbQ_8","position":31,"timestamp":"00:58:29","rawTrack":"Mary J. Blige - My Love (KLM Flip)","track":{"id":"4F_ZLecmFvY","path":"/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/my-love-klm-flip/","slug":"my-love-klm-flip","title":"My Love (KLM Flip)","artist":{"slug":"mary-j-blige","title":"Mary J. Blige"},"artwork":"images/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/my-love-klm-flip.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Qjt-p40LBfo","slug":"522","tags":[5,6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-522/ra.1585226526","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-522-k-le-maestro-takeover"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #522 (K, Le Maestro Takeover)","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-522.jpg","content":"London producer K, Le Maestro takes over the show.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-09-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"K, Le Maestro's Takeover","position":0}},{"id":"W9Vz_9k3T6I","position":27,"timestamp":"01:11:21","rawTrack":"Mary J. Blige - Didn't Mean (Bonus Track)","track":{"id":"0cmEH0Z1lFQ","path":"/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/didn-t-mean-bonus-track/","slug":"didnt-mean-bonus-track","title":"Didn't Mean (Bonus Track)","artist":{"slug":"mary-j-blige","title":"Mary J. Blige"},"artwork":"images/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/didn-t-mean-bonus-track.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"nAXGRREjC2k","slug":"564","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-564/ra.1641616009","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-564"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #564","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-564.jpg","content":"Blends and edits from all of our favorite producers and artists.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-09-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"Jb7FVvxuYn8","position":14,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mary J Blige - Be Happy (starRo remix)","track":{"id":"Fh9ZJPgeg1M","path":"/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/be-happy-starro-remix/","slug":"be-happy-starro-remix","title":"Be Happy (starRo remix)","artist":{"slug":"mary-j-blige","title":"Mary J. Blige"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zg_8tfPfypk","slug":"144","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-144-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #144 w/ starRo","artwork":"/images/episodes/144.jpg","content":"\nstarRo hails all the way from Tokyo, Japan to play original productions and edits.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere have been so many guests on Soulection Radio over the past years but no one, we repeat, no one has came in the studio so humble, so low key and just murk the airwaves like starRo did. \nIt's crazy to think that this man has been making music for over 15 years and is barely coming to surface to the world with so much heat. \nWe are just glad he is on our team. He played nothing but original production/edits. \nHailing all the way from Tokyo, Japan, starRo is an artist who you will be familiar with starting from this point on. \nJoe Kay of course opened the show for the first hour & 50 minutes on one turntable (one of the turntable's went out before the show started) playing a bunch of heat that he was holding onto since last week. \nHe made sure to make up for his absence last saturday and play some exclusive Carmack, Atu, Kaytra, Esta, Esgar, Jo Def + some other heavy footwork vibes.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"starRo's Set","position":1}},{"id":"USzg03Ir_oA","position":77,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mary J. Blige - Didn't Mean","track":{"id":"3FlLAe6qAqg","path":"/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/didn-t-mean/","slug":"didnt-mean","title":"Didn't Mean","artist":{"slug":"mary-j-blige","title":"Mary J. Blige"},"artwork":"images/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/didn-t-mean.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"BDetsr-_b9I","slug":"154","tags":[1,15],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #154","artwork":"/images/episodes/154.jpg","content":"Joe Kay really displayed a crazy selection of music that will have you copying/pasting consistently within Google for some time. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are a lot of new tunes sprinkled with the 'feel-good' classics that we always connect to our sets. It's essential for us to keep educating you with the influences and how it all connects to where we are today. Spread this set to as many people as possible! More minds and ears need to hear this music!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10901,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-30T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"duNWmuIYZvA","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mary J Blige - Love No Limit (Bad Boy Mix)","track":{"id":"HVR5n6bj5Qo","path":"/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/love-no-limit-bad-boy-mix/","slug":"love-no-limit-bad-boy-mix","title":"Love No Limit (Bad Boy Mix)","artist":{"slug":"mary-j-blige","title":"Mary J. Blige"},"artwork":"images/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/love-no-limit-bad-boy-mix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F65IztEdKlQ","slug":"158","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-158-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #158 w/ Kronika","artwork":"/images/episodes/158.jpg","content":"Joe Kay & Kronika hold it down with gems randing from unreleased to forthcoming material, plus forgotten classics. \n\n<!--more-->\nHere is our last the last show of 2013 and ending it with a BANG. \n\nEvery week just keeps getting better and better for us. The music, the accomplishments, and ideas just keep rising. \n\nThis week was supposed to be a ladies edition of Soulection Radio w/ Sasha Marie, Eden, and Kronika but Sasha and Eden both couldn't make it out this time along. \n\nWe'll catch you in 2014 and thank you again for your support. We appreciate you.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-28T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Kronika's Set + Interview","position":1}},{"id":"Dxw1TCI85oo","position":12,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mary J. Blige - I Can Love You (feat. Lil' Kim)","track":{"id":"PSJC7m15Dic","path":"/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/i-can-love-you-feat-lil-kim/","slug":"i-can-love-you-feat-lil-kim","title":"I Can Love You (feat. Lil' Kim)","artist":{"slug":"mary-j-blige","title":"Mary J. Blige"},"artwork":"images/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/i-can-love-you-feat-lil-kim.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"hcQDpG5xDmo","slug":"247","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-247/ra.1084901819","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-247-w-wondagurl"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #247 w/ Wondagurl","artwork":"/images/episodes/247.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7150,"location":"US","published_at":"2016-02-20T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"dCHmTs_dMUA","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mary J. Blige - I Can Love You","track":{"id":"PBKKUyRkSkg","path":"/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/i-can-love-you/","slug":"i-can-love-you","title":"I Can Love You","artist":{"slug":"mary-j-blige","title":"Mary J. Blige"},"artwork":"images/artists/mary-j-blige/tracks/i-can-love-you.jpg"},"c